## 🏗️ Build & Validation Checklist

After any structural or logic-level change:
```bash
npm run lint
npm run test
npm run build
```

Cursor must fix all lint/type errors and ensure the app builds cleanly before completing any task.

### Quality Gates
- **Linting**: All ESLint rules must pass
- **Type Checking**: TypeScript compilation must succeed
- **Testing**: All tests must pass with >80% coverage for business logic
- **Build**: Application must build successfully
- **Architecture**: Code must follow the three-layer model

